- **v2.4** (2026-05-11): CLI-only default, gate contract hard stop, background task protocol
- **v2.3** (2026-05-10): SOD enforcement, role mapping
- **v2.2** (2026-05-09): State persistence rules
- **v2.1** (2026-05-08): Initial OMEGA_QUANT alignment

