.ly_state/session/audit_reports/role20_p10_gate_tuning_compliance_audit_20260610.md:61:   - All horizon failure triggers baseline `return_col` fallback at `src/omega/quant/phase35_walk_forward.py:1702-1735`; script sets `RETURN_HORIZON = 5` and `return_col = f'fwd_ret_{RETURN_HORIZON}'` at `scripts/run_phase35_backtest.py:218-319`.
